contentText:
Rod Stewart is on the mend.

While out and about recently with his wife, Penny Lancaster, the rocker &#8212; who in August canceled the remaining dates on his North American tour after undergoing a heart procedure &#8212; gave The Daily Mail an update. &#8220;F&#8211;king brilliant!&#8221; he reportedly exclaimed on his and Lancaster&#8217;s way out of a Sinatra The Musical showing in London.

